+   "Chinese": "Loader 料盤層數偵測失敗（HT9050 Loader 抽屜）。\n(1) 層數偵測找不到最上層料盤：Loader 料盤感測器（SnLoaderTrayHasTray）往上到第 20 層每一層都有盤，或往下到第 1 層每一層都沒有盤。\n(2) 請確認 Loader 抽屜裡的料盤數量（最多 20 盤）與料盤感測器。\n(3) 按 <RETRY> 重新偵測層數。\n\nLoader tray layer detection failed (HT9050 loader drawer).\n(1) The layer probe found no top tray: the loader tray sensor (SnLoaderTrayHasTray) was on at every layer up to 20, or off at every layer down to 1.\n(2) Check the number of trays in the loader drawer (20 at most) and the loader tray sensor.\n(3) Press <RETRY> to detect the layers again.",
